  "title": "Baked Egg Casserole",
  "description": "Hard-cooked eggs and yummy cheesy sauce, spooned over toast points! This is my family&#39;s favorite holiday brunch. We call this dish &#39;Claudia&#39;s Eggs&#39;. Try to use extra sharp Cheddar cheese for the flavor.",
